id: copy-clone
name: Copy Clone
uaType: magical
prerequisite: Copy Being
tpCost: 20
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerBaseTier: 8
# The Character targeted - not at Long Range, no higher a Tier of Power (maneuvers.mjs whyNotCopyClone) - copied into a Duplicate
# Minion of yours, made beside you (chat.mjs copyClone). A Fusion, not in this system yet, the table's.
requiresTarget: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Duplicate Minion of a Character on the Battlefield not at Long Range and of no higher Tier, under your command.
text: >
  Copy Clone: You are able to create a perfect copy of another being, commanding that copy at-will.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: Copy Being
  –TP Cost: 20
  –KP Cost: 8(bT)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 1
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target a Character (except a Fusion) on the Battlefield who is not at Long Range. You create a Duplicate
  Minion, but instead of a Duplicate Minion of yourself, it is a Duplicate Minion of that Character (you are still their
  Master). You cannot target a Character whose Tier of Power is higher than yours.

---

# Paid for: the Duplicate Minion of the one targeted (chat.mjs copyClone).
[on used]
copyClone();
